# WorldVision Summons — local secrets (copy to `.env`)
#
# Text sheet generation works with a standard Gemini API key.
# LIVE Nano Banana / Gemini *image* portraits require billing enabled on the
# Google AI Studio / Cloud project (free-tier image models currently report limit: 0).
# Without billing, /api/generate-image returns a procedural SVG plate + BILLING_REQUIRED.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: force Vertex Imagen attempts (needs Vertex project credentials)
# GEMINI_USE_IMAGEN=1
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=

# --- Gemini proxy gate (Express) ---
# Shared secret for /api/generate-sheet, /api/generate-image, /api/summons/image,
# /api/chat, /api/summons/chat.
# - Unset + NODE_ENV!=production: routes stay open (local/dev).
# - Unset + NODE_ENV=production: routes return 403 (fail-closed).
# - Set: require header X-WVS-API-Key: <same value> (or Authorization: Bearer <same>).
# Do not commit real secrets. Client mirror (Vite): VITE_WVS_API_SECRET — bundled
# into the browser; treat as a deploy gate key, not a user credential.
# WVS_API_SECRET=
# VITE_WVS_API_SECRET=
